{
  "summary": "This experiment tested avgpool aggregation in a multimodal multiprofile setup with PCA (n=2000) RNA encoding and ResNet50 image encoding, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6186 and F1 of 0.6103, higher than prior multimodal baselines. The results suggest aggregation may improve performance in multiprofile settings, but the relative impact of aggregation versus multiprofile configuration remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative aggregation methods."
}

